Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: CLASS IDENTIFIER LBRACE classMembers RBRACE

    2 classMembers: classMembers classMember
    3             | ε

    4 classMember: methodDecl
    5            | fieldDecl
    6            | SEMICOLON

    7 methodDecl: PUBLIC STATIC methodHeader methodBody

    8 fieldDecl: PUBLIC STATIC type IDENTIFIER fieldDeclarations SEMICOLON
    9          | error SEMICOLON

   10 fieldDeclarations: fieldDeclarations COMMA IDENTIFIER
   11                  | ε

   12 type: BOOL
   13     | INT
   14     | DOUBLE

   15 methodHeader: type IDENTIFIER LPAR formalParams RPAR
   16             | VOID IDENTIFIER LPAR formalParams RPAR

   17 formalParams: type IDENTIFIER formalParamsList
   18             | STRING LSQ RSQ IDENTIFIER
   19             | ε

   20 formalParamsList: formalParamsList COMMA type IDENTIFIER
   21                 | ε

   22 methodBody: LBRACE methodBodyItems RBRACE

   23 methodBodyItems: methodBodyItems statement
   24                | methodBodyItems varDecl
   25                | ε

   26 varDecl: type IDENTIFIER idList SEMICOLON

   27 idList: idList COMMA IDENTIFIER
   28       | ε

   29 statement: LBRACE statementList RBRACE
   30          | IF LPAR expr RPAR statement
   31          | IF LPAR expr RPAR statement ELSE statement
   32          | WHILE LPAR expr RPAR statement
   33          | RETURN SEMICOLON
   34          | RETURN expr SEMICOLON
   35          | methodInvocation SEMICOLON
   36          | assignment SEMICOLON
   37          | parseArgs SEMICOLON
   38          | PRINT LPAR expr RPAR SEMICOLON
   39          | PRINT LPAR STRLIT RPAR SEMICOLON
   40          | SEMICOLON
   41          | error SEMICOLON

   42 statementList: statementList statement
   43              | ε

   44 methodInvocation: IDENTIFIER LPAR arguments RPAR
   45                 | IDENTIFIER LPAR error RPAR

   46 arguments: exprList
   47          | ε

   48 exprList: expr
   49         | exprList COMMA expr

   50 assignment: IDENTIFIER ASSIGN expr

   51 parseArgs: PARSEINT LPAR IDENTIFIER LSQ expr RSQ RPAR
   52          | PARSEINT LPAR error RPAR

   53 expr: expr PLUS expr
   54     | expr MINUS expr
   55     | expr STAR expr
   56     | expr DIV expr
   57     | expr MOD expr
   58     | expr AND expr
   59     | expr OR expr
   60     | expr XOR expr
   61     | expr LSHIFT expr
   62     | expr RSHIFT expr
